{
  "_comment": [
    "ONC series of the bridge `stations` dataset. Used by app/sources/onc_stations.py.",
    "stations: the observatories, in payload order. kind 'node' (seabed instrument platform) or 'shore'. lat, lon and depthM are shown on the map (depthM null on shore).",
    "series: payload key -> ONC sensor. location defaults to the station code; deviceCategory and sensorCategoryCode are ONC codes (checked against scalardata/location on 2026-08-17).",
    "unit: target unit, converted from the sensor's unitOfMeasure with onc.py CONVERSIONS. Omit to pass the value through.",
    "digits: decimals sent.",
    "aggregate: how samples become one value per step. 'avg' (default) = ONC resampleType=avg at the step. The others read raw samples (paged) and aggregate here: 'mean', 'max' (e.g. gusts), 'newest' (the newest sample in the step: headings and courses) and 'vector' (direction of the mean vector, weighted by the samples of `weight` from the same device, e.g. wind direction weighted by wind speed; unweighted when every weight in the step is 0). ONC's avg breaks angles across 0/360, so angles never use 'avg'.",
    "twdp: the second ONC ferry (BC Ferries Tsawwassen - Duke Point), one value per stepS (60 s replay). Its NAV device is at TWDP.N1, the water sensors at TWDP. TWDP TEMPSENSOR reads the water intake (same as TSG), so there is no airC."
  ],
  "stations": {
    "SCVIP": {
      "name": "Strait of Georgia Central (VENUS)", "kind": "node", "lat": 49.0401, "lon": -123.4255, "depthM": 296,
      "series": {
        "tempC": {"deviceCategory": "CTD", "sensorCategoryCode": "temperature", "unit": "C", "digits": 3},
        "sal": {"deviceCategory": "CTD", "sensorCategoryCode": "salinity", "digits": 3},
        "sigmaT": {"deviceCategory": "CTD", "sensorCategoryCode": "sigma_t", "digits": 3},
        "soundSpeed": {"deviceCategory": "CTD", "sensorCategoryCode": "sound_speed", "digits": 2},
        "o2MlL": {"deviceCategory": "OXYSENSOR", "sensorCategoryCode": "oxygen_corrected", "digits": 3},
        "o2Sat": {"deviceCategory": "OXYSENSOR", "sensorCategoryCode": "oxygen_saturation", "digits": 2},
        "chl": {"deviceCategory": "FLNTU", "sensorCategoryCode": "chlorophyll", "digits": 2},
        "turb": {"deviceCategory": "FLNTU", "sensorCategoryCode": "turbidity", "digits": 2},
        "curEastMs": {"deviceCategory": "CURRENTMETER", "sensorCategoryCode": "current_velocity_beam1_x_east", "unit": "m/s", "digits": 3},
        "curNorthMs": {"deviceCategory": "CURRENTMETER", "sensorCategoryCode": "current_velocity_beam2_y_north", "unit": "m/s", "digits": 3}
      }
    },
    "SEVIP": {
